698063466728","type":"quoted"}],"text":"周武王牧野誓师曰： 嗟！我有国冢君， 司徒、 司马、 司空、 亚旅、 师氏、 千夫长、 百夫长、 及庸、蜀、 羌、 穿、 微、 缠、 彭、 濮人、 称尔戈、 比尔干、 立尔矛、 予其哲......尔所不勉 其于尔身有戮！ https://t.co/xbbllcGi4R","url":"https://x.com/RickyYu6612/status/2112265686793773165"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112173407550783490"]},"author_id":"1868006938258128896","created_at":"2026-10-19T13:25:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112173414253293614"],"id":"2112173414253293614","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🙏🙏🙏\n\n《谛深⼤师开⽰辑》-什么是证得佛法\n\n坐下弟子及声闻善知识众， 所谓证得佛法是指：\n\n1、往生证得：若汝等修净土，生身能见弥陀能见极乐，并于死后由弥陀接引往\n生极乐世界安住，称为净土证得，若生身不能见弥陀见极乐，能于死后往生者，死 https://t.co/VICObZe8Hh","url":"https://x.com/wangjiziji/status/2112173414253293614"},{"author_id":"2869390354","created_at":"2026-10-18T12:11:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111792270269960476"],"id":"2111792270269960476","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":297,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"四圣谛\n\n佛陀最初讲说的道理，是“四圣谛”，即四个神圣的真理。\n\n第一是苦谛：人生充满了痛苦。生、老、病、死是苦，和讨厌的人在一起是苦，和喜爱的人分离是苦，想要的得不到是苦。佛教所说的“苦”，含义比日常所说的痛苦要宽，它也指一切事物都在变化、不能令人永远满足的那种不圆满。","url":"https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2111792270269960476"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112048195866103808"]},"author_id":"2111532677568647168","created_at":"2026-10-19T05:12:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112049190650159418"],"id":"2112049190650159418","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"手姐云缠{国际版}\n2026.10.18日缠论量化买卖点汇总\n#缠论 bitcoin:native https://t.co/hOHj4qmvR0","url":"https://x.com/sjyclh_top/status/2112049190650159418"},{"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:19:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111990471543435585"],"id":"2111990471543435585","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"